   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sunset landscape with lake, clouds on red sky, silhouettes on hills and trees on coast. Vector cartoon illustration of nature scenery with sunrise, coniferous forest on river shore</rdf:li>
